---
profile: production
offline: true
skip_list:
  # The role variables (deploy_user, admin_user, session_secret, ufw_allowed_tcp_ports, ...) are the operator-facing
  # interface documented in README.md and shared across roles (deploy_user is used by hardening, docker and app), so
  # they are not prefixed with a role name.
  - var-naming[no-role-prefix]
